    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d500">

                <pb facs="0580" n="468" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg468"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/3802: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul at
                        Vladivostok</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-02-13T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 13,
                                1919, 4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your February 4, 1 p.m. Department believes inadvisable that this Government
                    should be represented in negotiations between Kolchak and Semenoff. Advise
                    Consul General, Omsk.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
